# Walkthrough: Unified Card Sizes

I have homogenized the card sizes in both the "Portafolio de Servicios" and "Beneficios" sections to ensure a perfectly consistent and premium look across all devices.

## Changes Made

### [Services Component](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Services.tsx)

- **Standardized Size**: All cards now have a fixed height of `400px` (mobile) and `450px` (desktop), regardless of their content.
- **Auditorías Logic**: A special font-scaling logic was applied to the "Auditorías" card so its extensive content fits within the same container size as the others.
- **Refined Width**: Card widths were narrowed slightly to `230px`/`260px` for a more elegant vertical appearance.

### [Benefits Component](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Benefits.tsx)

- **Uniform Height**: Applied `h-[350px]` and `justify-center` to all benefit cards.
- **Mobile Spacing**: Added `gap-6` to the mobile container to provide a clean separation between cards during horizontal scroll.
- **Visual Balance**: Adjusted icon sizes and internal padding for a cleaner, unified aesthetic.

